<title>POLAND: LDA NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 26.000.</title>
<headline>LDA NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 26.000.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.03 vs   0.07</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.05 vs   0.14</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.06 vs   0.20</p>
<p> Sales		    2.24 vs   2.35</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.80 vs   0.50</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.43 vs   0.93</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.37 vs   1.40</p>
<p> Sales		   27.75 vs  24.87</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish printing house is Ludzka</p>
<p>Drukarnia Akcydensowa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
